{"page":{"id":"5a3af081-0ce6-40d4-9524-346d696c7ada","theme":"battletech","slug":"/battletech/battlemechs","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/battletech/battlemechs","title":"BattleMechs","meta_title":"BattleMechs (BattleTech) — concept, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"BattleMechs are towering humanoid engines of war piloted by MechWarriors, dominating BattleTech battlefields through armor, weapons pods, and the prestige…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Humanoid war machines central to <a href=\"/battletech\" class=\"entity-link\">BattleTech</a> warfare.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/battletech\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>BattleTech</strong></a>, <a href=\"/battletech/clans/clan-invasion\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Clan Invasion</strong></a>, <a href=\"/battletech/mechwarrior\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>MechWarrior</strong></a>, <a href=\"/battletech/clans/natasha-kerensky\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Natasha Kerensky</strong></a>, <a href=\"/battletech/inner-sphere/house-davion\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>House Davion</strong></a> and <a href=\"/battletech/fasa\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>FASA</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How BattleMechs connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Part Of:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/battletech\" class=\"entity-link\">BattleTech</a>\n            — BattleMechs define <a href=\"/battletech\" class=\"entity-link\">BattleTech</a> warfare.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Involves:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/battletech/clans/clan-invasion\" class=\"en